{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_hsguma_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_hsguma_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"抉擇過後","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_hsguma_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"83adcdce209c933c7033bb98c19c05b2702d68796f0b65b6cb3867aae8bdc351","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"決定接受近衛局的邀約之後，星熊和三個小弟打算一起“熱鬧一下”，但那三人卻無論如何都沒辦法接受鬼姐即將加入近衛局這件事。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老董，我們來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來了啊。老樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老樣子，兩個麻辣、一個咖哩、一個原味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"還是老董的鱗丸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼可以叫老董？年輕人叫董阿伯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"就只是說得太順而已嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平常叫你笨大頭也就算了，你還真的以為自己笨就可以亂說話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森，你今天怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是看大頭笨笨的樣子不順眼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"他笨又怎麼樣？鬼姐有說什麼嗎？你現在搞這齣是想給誰看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"阿祥！我笨就笨，沒關係啦，你們兩個別吵架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你也幫忙勸一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你們啊，肚子餓了，就講不出好話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森，跟大頭道個歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起，我剛剛火氣太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你，阿祥，你跟阿森道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿祥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我不應該講話這麼嗆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣不就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森&阿祥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"聊點別的。鬼姐，前天那個“缺一門”被你做掉之後，他手底下的人怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生有他的安排，我沒多問。看樣子只不過是讓他們以後收斂一點，這樣他們就該偷笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？還有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實就是想問你一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笨大頭的嘴也很笨。我來說。鬼姐，今天不是我們……這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你們啊，唉，真的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，我幫他們說。今天你把以後的事跟我們說了一下，我們不就決定要一起來熱鬧一下嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"以後我們可能就沒有這個機會了，所以其實就是想問你，到底為什麼，你要去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"借過借過，鱗丸來囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就當作是幫下城區除害的謝禮，每人送一塊蘿蔔，再額外送一份羽獸翅給星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥&阿森&大頭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我知道你們幾個有心事，但平常嘴都那麼甜，還號稱要教我怎麼油嘴滑舌，現在怎麼都不說話了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥&阿森&大頭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝董阿伯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你突然告訴他們這麼大一件事，幾個孩子一時之間接受不了，也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"董阿伯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醬料都在檯面上了，自己加。我先去跑外送了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫“這麼大一件事”？鬼姐出門前才告訴我們的，為什麼連他都知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，道上這幾年算是白混了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"董阿伯為什麼跛了一條腿？是幫那個誰擋的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？林先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底什麼時候才會開竅！林先生你都敢說，我不敢說嗎？那個不能說的，你覺得是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"是魏——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還知道說個姓就停下來，我是不是還得謝謝你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉抱歉，我的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"董阿伯和林先生直到現在都是說得上話的老兄弟，他們兩個之前都是幫那個誰做事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我就說林先生這段時間怎麼老是派一些嚇人的工作給鬼姐，先是“羽翅伍”，然後是“喪門錢”，再然後是今天的“缺一門”……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"飯桌一時又靜下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大頭，你這張破嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你不是說東國人喜歡一個晚上吃遍整條街上的路邊攤嗎？大家的鱗丸也吃得差不多了，不如我們換個地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。現在才剛開始，怎麼可以就這麼結束了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是得有酒喝才盡興！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等一下，你今晚最好一句話也別說，免得又掃興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這個笨大頭，真不讓人放心。鬼姐，我猜他現在還把你當豐蹄呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣說就不對了。鬼姐是從東國來的鬼，這種事我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐來龍門不是一年兩年了，在提點我們這幾個不成器的東西之前，鬼姐是混兩儀會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"兩儀會？那個窮凶極惡的兩儀會？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為呢。鬼姐雖然身處兩儀會，為人處世卻特別正義，當時有一大堆人都挺她，林先生也是那個時候看中鬼姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"當年勇，別提了。是我當時鋒芒太露，兩儀會才……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼能怪你？那還不是林先生藉你的手？沒有你，他還不會找別人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不如說因為有鬼姐，兩儀會才有將近一半的人得以善終。道上哪一個人因為這件事說過你半句閒話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是為鬼姐打抱不平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年林先生用了她一次，平了兩儀會和八卦幫。不說給道上立下什麼規矩吧，至少從那之後，龍門再也沒有什麼起勢的大幫派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年，那些餘孽又開始東山再起，所以林先生又用她一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果呢……呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不說了。喝酒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？你幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐！有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想報信？李寶發，我看你是活膩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"星熊倏然起身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿發？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不起眼的酒保","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳……我沒事，鬼姐你在這裡，他不敢下重手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"留個大名，免得以後找不到人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用問我是混哪條道上的。我來就為了一件事，聽說你最近幹了票大的，兄弟特地來幫你賀喜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男子啪的一聲，把啤酒瓶底在桌上砸掉，參差的玻璃上泛出危險的光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就憑一個破啤酒瓶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"破啤酒瓶？那你也太小看這裡面的東西了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男子把手伸進瓶中，掏出一卷信紙，手被劃得鮮血淋漓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快、快報警！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說要報警的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽口音，應該不是龍門人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知者不怪。這個電話你儘管打吧。條子什麼時候能管到我們下城區了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他們招來，讓他們白跑一趟，你覺得他們會拿誰出氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼會這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次好好做一下旅遊攻略，別來這種貧民窟了，聽到沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遊客急忙跑出酒吧。\n兇惡的男子再度轉向星熊一行人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"言歸正傳，“鬼姐”，從今天開始，你就是全龍門幫會的公敵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐殺的都是以大欺小、和你們作對的幫派頭子，你們謝鬼姐還來不及，還要與她為敵？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在幫誰做事，你當我們不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天姓林的說“缺一門”該殺，她就殺“缺一門”，明天姓林的說輪到我們家大哥了，我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在場的諸位，不是道上的煩請幫我們做證；是道上的，那就給我記住了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙，以後永遠都是我們龍門下城區的叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"你在胡說什麼？鬼姐背叛誰了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是已經接了龍門近衛局的邀約，要去當條子了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個殺人不眨眼的惡鬼，連續幹掉好幾個黑道上的大人物，就為了向條子表達忠心，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你血口噴人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我血口噴人？她自己怎麼不否認？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才我就看你們一團愁雲慘霧，你們三個是不是也想不通，好好的“鬼姐”，怎麼就變成條子了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們三個要是還想在道上混，就儘快和這個惡鬼撇清關係。我們是打不過她沒錯，但她還能二十四小時保護你們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要你來挑撥離間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賴金森，你堂上老母的身體還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不用跟幾個年輕人過不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一人做事一人擔？“鬼姐”還是那麼講義氣。不知道手裡的刀太講義氣，姓林的到底喜不喜歡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……跟林先生沒關係，這是我的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"在場的各位也聽好了。要是有哪個人，敢無緣無故對我身邊這幾個人，或者這幾個人的親朋好友下手……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那就別怪我和般若追他到天涯海角，把他整個碾碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，話帶到了，我的事也辦完了。走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不起眼的酒保","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，別聽那個混蛋亂說。還要喝點什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿發……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不給你添麻煩了，結帳吧，我們換個地方再喝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下城區竟然沒有一家店敢再接待我們了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，酒也去便利商店買來了，也沒人再來打擾我們，在哪裡喝都是喝。我們找個涼快一點的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"涼快？我看近衛局的樓頂最涼快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大頭，你在亂說什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我非說不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生到底是哪根筋不對勁了，才讓鬼姐去近衛局當條子？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥&阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那個拿啤酒瓶的是該死沒錯，但……但我真的想不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我想不通！阿森、阿祥，你們能想通嗎？鬼姐，你就想得通嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我是笨大頭沒錯，你們聰明，你們告訴我，就這件事，姓林的，還有那個姓魏什麼，他們到底有什麼目的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是一開始就跟你們說了，是我自己決定答應魏先生的邀約——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你得答應！鬼姐，我不是說反話，我講真的，這份邀約到了你面前，你沒辦法不答應！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"經過剛才的事，哪怕是我也明白了，你現在就是所有幫派的眼中釘，他們要想盡辦法把你拔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時候姓林的該幹什麼？他應該挺你啊！但他幹了什麼？他讓你去當條子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你再拒絕他，那你以後在龍門還怎麼混？你只能答應！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你忘了條子是怎麼對我們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"在他們眼裡，我們根本不是人，他們根本不把我們當人看，只知道在我們頭頂作威作福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，說實話，我也想不通。一個混道上的，進了近衛局，能有什麼好下場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"要我看，姓……林先生這就是向剩下的幫會示好，把你塞進近衛局，讓所有人看你的笑話，他再慢慢處理剩下的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿祥話音未落，阿森猛地站了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森，你做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不做什麼。我去近衛局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚了，近衛局已經關門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我管他呢。門不開，我就往上爬，一直爬到樓頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幫混蛋條子不是一直騎在我們頭上作威作福嗎？今晚我們就爬上他們的頭頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三個小弟拎著酒瓶，拔腿就往近衛局的方向走。\n星熊本來可以攔住他們，但她慢了一步。\n又或者，她本來也沒有能攔住這幾個真心為她著想的小弟的決心。\n……他們擔心的甚至是鬼姐進了近衛局被人欺負，而不是鬼姐走了自己怎麼辦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……哈……我們這樣就……進來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"樓頂有東西擋住，只能先從最上面的倉庫進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到，連近衛局樓頂也是這麼亂七八糟，破破爛爛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你……這樣跟我們過來，真的好嗎？你很快就要來這裡報到了，萬一你的上司發現你跟我們幾個跑到這裡來鬧了一通……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼。天塌下來，我個子高又有角，大不了戳幾個洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我真怕，鬼姐。我怕你這個性格，進了近衛局過了一年半載，也被他們搓扁揉圓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐不會的。如果真的有那麼一天，大不了再來找我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿森仰頭灌了一大口酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐不在的這段時間，我們先撐住。我不信鬼姐能一直受那群混蛋的氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……鬼姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我進近衛局，不是林先生的意思，而是魏先生的。他有什麼必要幫林先生善後？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛不是還說董阿伯和林先生是他手下的得力幹將嗎？如果我出了什麼事，鬼姐你不幫我擺平嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不要看看這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是剛剛那個混蛋從酒瓶子裡拿出來的破紙片嗎？有什麼好看的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你看落款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"銅槳幫、鐵錨幫、聯興會……豉油幫、白灼幫……叉燒幫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"誰取的名字？是不是被自己老媽罵昏頭了，才幫自己的幫派取名叫“叉燒幫”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪名字都是最近才成立的新幫會。在林先生的威嚇下，他們已經不敢用什麼“兩儀”、“八卦”之類的名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你以為他們今天為什麼跑過來立威？他們要是真的敢越過林先生對我們下手，還會費盡心思演一齣啤酒瓶劃手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門會變好的。我願意相信這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"相比我剛來龍門的時候，這裡已經變了一些，接下來，它會變得更好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，如果你說的是真的，他們讓你避避風頭，等林先生把這些幫派壓下去，你再回來，不就好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"非要讓你當條子嗎？是因為鬼姐你以前在東國做過條子？要是這樣，那我沒話說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我在那邊做過的事……比在龍門還糟糕。不然，我也不會背井離鄉來到龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"歸根究柢，他們就是不想讓你好過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"頂樓倉庫裡的空氣剛因為“叉燒幫”這個名字鬆動了幾分，又隨著眾人的沉默凝結回去。\n幾個小弟一人抱著一個瓶子自斟自飲，眼睛越喝越紅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正龍門要變好了，只有我們不會好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，以前你在東國想必有什麼傷心事，你沒說過，我也不問，我只說龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在兩儀會過得好好的，但姓林的毀了兩儀會，把你變成了獨行俠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你遇見了我們，拉了我們一把，讓我們活得多少有了點人樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是想讓你能把我們幾個當成家人的，我們想讓你出人頭地、揚名立萬，你有這個能力、有這個資格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果現在呢？他們硬生生地把你的頭按下去，讓你去受條子的氣……他們到底有什麼權利這麼做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你剛剛說你願意相信龍門會變好，你到底是真的相信，還是只是願意相信？如果只是願意相信，我……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去當條子，除非先把我殺了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿森快步往天台跑去，狠狠撞開鎖得不緊的大門，夜晚的冷風灌進倉庫，激起一陣嗆鼻的霉味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森，你喝多了。下樓，我們回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"家？我跟阿公低個頭認個錯，我還能有家，但鬼姐你呢？你難道真的要信那些有權有勢的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別相信那些人說的，他們手裡有權，只會把我們當成物品來回玩弄！他們從來沒把我們放在眼裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森，你剛才問我到底是真的相信還是願意相信，你猜得對，龍門會不會變好，我也沒有十足的把握。但我得相信。我必須相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我在第一次遇到你們的時候，就要先懷疑你們是不是哪個仇家設下的誘餌，或者收買的刺客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個毀了自己原來的家的鬼，不得已來了龍門。我一開始不相信自己能融入這裡，只想當個孤家寡人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"是兩儀幫裡那些講義氣的兄弟帶我走過高樓大廈、街頭巷尾，帶我吃叉燒、滷味、咖哩鱗丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我的龍門方言之前一直說不好，是你們陪我一遍遍地練習。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是林先生，他也從沒在我背後捅過我刀子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我得相信他。不然……"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿森背脊一陣發涼。他知道星熊沒說出來的是什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moonmasked"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打個賭嗎？就賭你在龍門近衛局不超過半年，半年之後你就會走人，再也不想回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不賭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不敢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經在賭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你賭龍門會善待你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道賭輸了有多可怕，我怕看到你賭輸的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我怕看到你這個天不怕地不怕，最近還跟我們學了一些油嘴滑舌的鬼姐……再被狠狠捅一刀，狼狽不堪的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕用我的這條命，我也不能讓你和那群腦滿腸肥的混蛋賭這一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你就當我是無論如何都吞不下這口氣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森，別做傻事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moon"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿森往後退，往後退，往後退，直到腳後跟懸在空中。\n他實在不知道接下來該怎麼辦了。\n於是，藉著酒勁，他咬咬牙，整個人往後倒去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然後，自己被人狠狠拉住衣領，又狠狠吃了一記耳光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你瘋了？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"被失重感驅散了大半的酒勁一下子消失無蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"別說話了，給我下樓！我今天得親眼盯著你們三個回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"證明文件、筆記本、報到用的照片和表格……都帶了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐——不是，星熊警官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿森？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑到這裡幹什麼？該不會又想爬去上面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐你說的是什麼話，昨晚不是喝多了嗎？事後我也想了，確實是我不對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那你來這裡幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是經推薦入職的星熊小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你後面那幾個呢？他們也是來入職的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"報告長官，我們是星熊警官今天上班路上抓到的三個幫派分子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊警官一招把我們三個全打趴了，上班第一天就抓了三個壞人，您看她是不是特別厲害……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿祥","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）笨大頭，哪有你這樣幫別人邀功的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，你們三個去忙你們的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我們真的是幫派分子，身上還帶了不少錢！把我們抓起來，近衛局又能查扣現金又能立功——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官剛開始加強整頓執法紀律，你們就跑來找我走後門？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您看出來了，那還不快點往我頭上敲一棍？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？往你頭上敲一棍？我懂了，你是來釣鱗的。我給你一棍，你就一封檢舉信寄到近衛局，我就會丟掉飯碗，是不是這樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"但我看你們三個的皮確實有點癢。不然這樣吧，星熊小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你跟我說“這三個混蛋騷擾我”，我就有合理的理由把他們三個抓進去反省幾天。你覺得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿祥和大頭一溜煙跑遠了。\n阿森也轉過身去，但在拔腿跑路之前，他還是回過頭，又看了星熊一眼。\n星熊也在看他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你覺得我會賭贏，還是賭輸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，不過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我至少敢期待你能賭贏了，鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你願意相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……假如，我是說假如……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如你最後還是輸了，別忘了我們幾個。我們會一直等你回來的，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會記住的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"近衛局門口的裝潢雖然樸素，卻太過刺眼，刺得阿森的雙眼幾乎要流出淚來。\n他不敢再看，胡亂在臉上抹了兩把，朝著星熊的方向微微鞠了一躬，隨後跟著兩個兄弟一起跑向下城區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"真是莫名其妙。這幾個混混是不是來跟你裝熟的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你說，對付這種不成器的混混，沒必要顧慮面子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是我的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是我的兄弟。一直都是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
